2 CONT (Myron Cunningham /Wiser/, BIRT 29 May 1891, DEAT 30 Jul 1963) = MYRON CUNNINGHAM WISER (1891-1963),
2 CONT son of JOHN HARVEY WISER (1858-1950) and EUSTACIA RAWLINS CUNNINGHAM (1862-1947); husband of ZELMA S
2 CONT SMITH (verified); father of 7 children in Lewiston, Utah (including Theron Telford Wiser, b. 1926 -
2 CONT post-1900, not in the verified tree). Evidence: Lawrence Wiser obituary (2022 - 'to Myron Cunningham
2 CONT Wiser and Zelma Smith Wiser... sixth of seven children') + Rawlins.org pedigree (John Harvey +
2 CONT Eustacia -> Myron). New combined source @S900000108@ (N-13).
2 CONT ADJUDICATION (N-3): identity established - obituary + pedigree + vitals. Tree data kept verbatim (N-5).
2 CONT OPEN QUESTIONS (N-22 marker attached): (1) NO FAMC @F900009018@ carried yet (John Harvey Wiser + Eustacia
2 CONT Cunningham - next backward step); (2) @F900009274@ (Myron + Zelma -> 7 children) NOT carried - all children
2 CONT post-1900, excluded per Kit's rule.
1 NOTE BUILD: @I232102449537@ carried as an INDIVIDUAL ONLY. Excluded per N-21, mapped: NO FAMC @F900009018@ carried yet (John Harvey Wiser + Eustacia Cunningham - next backward step); NO FAMS @F900009274@ carried (all 7 children post-1900, excluded per Kit's rule).
