2 CONT (Eustacia Rawlins /Cunningham/, also recorded as Eustucia /Iunningham/, BIRT 30 Apr 1862 Salt Lake City,
2 CONT DEAT 9 Oct 1947 Lewiston, Cache, Utah) = EUSTACIA RAWLINS CUNNINGHAM (1862-1947), wife of JOHN HARVEY
2 CONT WISER (verified); mother of MYRON CUNNINGHAM WISER (1891, verified). Daughter of ANDREW CUNNINGHAM and
2 CONT LUCINDA ANN RAWLINS (per Rawlins.org - not yet verified).
2 CONT Evidence: kalloch.org (vitals) + Rawlins.org (pedigree). New combined source @S900000109@ (N-13).
2 CONT ADJUDICATION (N-3): identity established - vitals + pedigree + spouse link. Tree data kept verbatim (N-5).
2 CONT OPEN QUESTIONS (N-22 marker attached): (1) NO FAMC carried (Andrew Cunningham + Lucinda Ann Rawlins -
2 CONT candidate future run).
2 CONT FOLLOW-UP (07 Oct 2026): FAMC @F900009511@ CARRIED (ledger 20261007-2038) - Andrew Cunningham + Lucinda Ann Rawlins -> Eustacia (rawlins.org pedigree + Lucinda's record + FamilySearch page). COMPLETES the bridge Edward E. Cunningham -> Adam -> Andrew -> Eustacia into the verified Wiser line. No FAMC for Andrew (carried @F900003967@) changes.
