2 CONT HARRIET MATILDA GOULD (verified); remained in the church and traveled west to Utah with his mother
2 CONT and brother Seymour Jr.; died in Fillmore, Utah. Evidence: Latter Day Light ('their second son,
2 CONT Lewis, who was born just ten days later' - Seymour baptized 17 Jan 1831 in Strongsville, Ohio, so
