2 CONT church and traveled West with Harriet') + FamilyCentral (child #2 under Seymour/Harriet: b. 27 Jan
2 CONT 1831 Mantua, Portage, Ohio EXACT; d. 4 Jan 1888 Fillmore, Millard, Utah EXACT; m. 31 Mar 1857 Salt
2 CONT Lake City). The parentage LINK (Seymour + Harriet -> Lewis) is directly attested on both sources.
2 CONT New combined source @S900000099@ (N-13).
2 CONT ADJUDICATION (N-3): identity unambiguous - name + BIRT 27 Jan 1831 Mantua OH + DEAT 4 Jan 1888
2 CONT Fillmore UT + 'second son of Seymour and Harriet' all match both sources EXACTLY. Tree data kept
2 CONT verbatim (N-5). FamilyCentral is user-tree-derived (Ancestral File/IGI/PRF) - corroborating only;
2 CONT Latter Day Light is the substantive source.
